    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d263">

                <pb facs="0645" n="525" xml:id="pg525"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.73/133: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Argentina</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">White</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-02-09T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                                1922—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>4. Your No. 8, February 7, 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>Your action approved.</p>
                <p>Department informed by local representative of Western Union and of Western
                    Telegraph Company that appropriate instructions to make necessary corrections on
                    both points mentioned by you will be sent immediately to Oldham.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
